# {{title}} {#p-top}

`ch07-source.geml` next to this file is written in English, once. Everything
below is a **projection** of it: each block is pulled by reference and rendered
in the language its embed asks for. No translated text is stored anywhere — not
in that file, and not in this one.

=== note {.tip #p-narration}
This paragraph is narration and stays English on purpose: a projection
translates the blocks it **borrows**, not the document doing the borrowing. What
follows the next heading is borrowed, and it moves.
===

